%global debug_package %{nil}
%global _debugsource_packages 0
%global __brp_mangle_shebangs %{nil}

Name:           @PKG_NAME@
Version:        @KREL_VERSION@
Release:        14%{?dist}
Summary:        Development files for the gaokun3 kernel
License:        GPL-2.0-only
ExclusiveArch:  aarch64
AutoReqProv:    no
Source0:        @SOURCE_NAME@
Requires:       @REQUIRES_MODULES@ = %{version}-%{release}

%description
Prepared build tree for compiling external modules against the gaokun3 kernel @KREL@.

%prep
%setup -q -c -T
tar -xzf %{SOURCE0}

%build

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
cp -a usr %{buildroot}/

%files
/usr/src/kernels/@KREL@
/usr/lib/modules/@KREL@/build
/usr/lib/modules/@KREL@/source

%changelog
* Thu Oct 15 2026 Gaokun buildbot - @KREL_VERSION@-14
- Integrate SC8280XP Iris hardware decoding fixes

* Wed Oct 14 2026 Gaokun buildbot - @KREL_VERSION@-13
- Match the kernel and module packages with ADSP attach and speaker-gain fixes

* Sat Oct 10 2026 Gaokun buildbot - @KREL_VERSION@-12
- Pin Gaokun3 primary planes to their CRTCs for display-owner handoff
- Retain asynchronous UCSI initialization and disconnect recovery

* Sat Oct 10 2026 Gaokun buildbot - @KREL_VERSION@-11
- Recover asynchronous Gaokun UCSI initialization without replacing DRM bridges
- Replay all Type-C port states and process USB/DP events outside the EC IRQ thread

* Wed Oct 07 2026 Gaokun buildbot - @KREL_VERSION@-10
- Start from the pinned Fedora arm64 configuration and retain Gaokun patch requirements
- Add opt-in QSEE fTPM validation with HLOS sharing for firmware control memory
- Package matching aarch64 kernel development files for Gaokun

* Sat Mar 28 2026 cool <bilibili@att.net> - @KREL_VERSION@-1
- Build gaokun3 kernel devel RPM
